[namespace.udecl]/2 + [class.inhctor.init]: inherited constructor templates
forward their arguments to the base constructor (plain classes and class
templates), and the derived class's own constructor takes precedence over an
inherited one of the same signature.  Cross-checked against g++ and clang++.
